### ============================================
### EXPENSE MANAGEMENT TESTS
### ============================================

### Create Expense - Equal Split (Marius pays for dinner)
# @name createExpenseEqual
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{marius_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": {{group_id}},
  "amount": 320.0,
  "description": "Dinner at restaurant",
  "category": "Food",
  "splitType": "equal"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("expense_id", response.body.id);
    client.log("Expense ID: " + response.body.id);
%}

###

### Create Expense - Custom Split (Rolf pays for hotel)
# @name createExpenseCustom
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{rolf_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": {{group_id}},
  "amount": 500.0,
  "description": "Hotel booking",
  "category": "Accommodation",
  "splitType": "custom",
  "splits": [
    {
      "userId": {{marius_id}},
      "shareAmount": 300.0
    },
    {
      "userId": {{rolf_id}},
      "shareAmount": 200.0
    }
  ]
}

###

### Get Group Expenses
GET http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/group/{{group_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{marius_token}}

###

### Get Group Balances
GET http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/group/{{group_id}}/balances
Authorization: Bearer {{marius_token}}

###

### Delete Expense (only payer can delete)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/{{expense_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{marius_token}}

###

### ============================================
### EXPENSE VALIDATION TESTS
### ============================================

### Create Expense - Not a Member (should fail with 403)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{marius_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": 999,
  "amount": 100.0,
  "description": "Should fail - not a member",
  "splitType": "equal"
}

###

### Create Expense - Negative Amount (should fail with 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{marius_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": {{group_id}},
  "amount": -50.0,
  "description": "Negative amount test",
  "splitType": "equal"
}

###

### Create Expense - Zero Amount (should fail with 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{marius_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": {{group_id}},
  "amount": 0.0,
  "description": "Zero amount test",
  "splitType": "equal"
}

###

### Create Expense - Empty Description (should fail with 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{marius_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": {{group_id}},
  "amount": 100.0,
  "description": "",
  "splitType": "equal"
}

###

### Create Expense - Custom Split Sum Mismatch (should fail with 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{marius_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": {{group_id}},
  "amount": 100.0,
  "description": "Bad split",
  "splitType": "custom",
  "splits": [
    {
      "userId": {{marius_id}},
      "shareAmount": 30.0
    },
    {
      "userId": {{rolf_id}},
      "shareAmount": 50.0
    }
  ]
}

###

### Create Expense - Custom Split Missing Splits (should fail with 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{marius_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": {{group_id}},
  "amount": 100.0,
  "description": "Custom without splits",
  "splitType": "custom"
}

