### ============================================
### SETTLEMENT TESTS
### ============================================

### Get Settlement Suggestions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/settlements/group/{{group_id}}/suggestions
Authorization: Bearer {{marius_token}}

###

### Create Settlement (Rolf pays Marius manually)
# @name createSettlement
POST http://localhost:8080/api/settlements
Authorization: Bearer {{rolf_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": {{group_id}},
  "toUserId": {{marius_id}},
  "amount": 160.0
}

> {%
    client.global.set("settlement_id", response.body.id);
    client.log("Settlement ID: " + response.body.id);
%}

###

### Get All Settlements for Group
GET http://localhost:8080/api/settlements/group/{{group_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{marius_token}}

###

### Get Pending Settlements Only
GET http://localhost:8080/api/settlements/group/{{group_id}}?pending=true
Authorization: Bearer {{marius_token}}

###

### Mark Settlement as Completed (only recipient Marius can mark)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/settlements/{{settlement_id}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{marius_token}}

###

